From 13c3780570cd4b8a3c9e05a49685cc3ce383aaa9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 10:07:55 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] feat(kanban): stable rejection class on every kanban_complete
 tool_error [daveey]

Each refusal now carries rejection in {goal_judge, phantom_cards, artifacts,
empty, live_claim, stale_run, parents, not_owner, invalid_args, error}
(COMPLETE_REJECTION_CLASSES) so digests can count failed completions by
cause instead of grepping prose. Coach proposal 2026-10-19-6, part 1.
---
